13770 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Independently trained networks are joined by curves of near\055constant loss\054 with barriers that vanish as width grows \050Garipov 2018\073 Draxler 2018\051\056 Straight\055line connectivity is rarer\072 it holds after a shared early trajectory \050Frankle 2020\051\054 from a common pretrained checkpoint \050Neyshabur 2020\051\054 or once neuron permutations are aligned \050Entezari 2022\073 Ainsworth 2023\051\054 and it fails between solutions that use different mechanisms \050Lubana 2023\051\056 Theory matches the pattern\072 one extra neuron per layer joins all permuted minima into a single manifold \050\136im\137ek 2021\051\054 and for degenerate tanh nets the entire equivalence class is path\055connected \050Farrugia\055Roberts 2023\051\056)
     /K [ 5 ]
